# Machine-written and content-hashed. Prettier would reformat them and break
# `--check` in CI, which compares against a freshly generated file byte for byte.
apps/web/src/lib/generated/
# Every JSON under data/reference/ is emitted by build_reference_payloads.py and
# then SHA-256'd into the manifest. Letting prettier reformat one — it collapses
# short arrays that json.dumps expands — silently decouples the checked-in bytes
# from the hash they are recorded under. The YAML in this tree is hand-written
# input and stays formatted.
data/reference/*.json
